  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845853,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 007 - From Russia with Love (GameCube)\n\nStep back into the iconic world of James Bond with *007 - From Russia with Love* for the GameCube, a thrilling reimagining of the classic 1963 film. As the legendary 007, you’re thrust into a dangerous mission to rescue the Prime Minister’s daughter, Elizabeth Stark, from the clutches of the shadowy organization OCTOPUS – a replacement for the legally restricted SPECTRE. \n\nExperience a cinematic adventure featuring Sean Connery’s likeness and voice, bringing a touch of authentic Bond charm to the gameplay. The game expands upon the film’s narrative with new scenes and action sequences, while retaining the core plot involving a Soviet encoding machine and a double-crossing Soviet agent, Tatiana Romanova. \n\nEngage in intense third-person shooter combat, utilizing Bond’s signature Walther PPK and a variety of gadgets like the Aston Martin DB5 and a jetpack. Upgrade your arsenal, unlock bonus content, and navigate treacherous environments, all while battling formidable foes and uncovering a sinister conspiracy. Relive the golden age of espionage in this action-packed tribute to a Bond classic."
    },
